    Add API endpoints for playlist management in the admin interface (#7496)
    
    This adds endpoints that allow creating, reading, updating and deleting
    playlists in the Admin UI. They are mostly copied over from the external
    API but have some additions, mainly related to filtering. This PR also
    adds a basic listprovider for that purpose.
    
    Frontend for this is in
    https://github.com/opencast/opencast-admin-interface/pull/1537
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    When you check out and install this branch, you can test the endpoints
    in the REST Service Documentation under `/admin-ng/playlists`
    
    Part of https://github.com/opencast/opencast/issues/6909
    (should only be closed once both this and the admin UI PR are merged)
    
